OL,3,GNEWSA'I use a bowl to wash myself and
OL,4,AI'm #400 in debt - energy price rise
OL,5,Ascares me'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA woman who no longer cooks hot meals,
OL,8,Fand washes herself using a bowl to save
OL,9,Fmoney, says the thought of a big rise
OL,10,Fin the cost of energy from January has
OL,11,Fsent her anxiety "through the roof".
OL,13,FHolly, who is 49 and has serious health
OL,14,Fconditions, says she owes her
OL,15,Felectricity provider #400, and wears
OL,16,Flayers to cut back on heating at home.
OL,18,F"You shouldn't have to live like this,"
OL,19,Fshe said. "I feel like we're going
OL,20,Fbackwards to when they were giving out
OL,21,Frations after the war - it's scary."
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
