OL,3,GNEWSA'I use a bowl to wash myself and
OL,4,AI'm #400 in debt - energy price rise
OL,5,Ascares me'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe energy regulator Ofgem has
OL,8,Fconfirmed that the energy price cap
OL,9,Fwill increase by 26% in January, which
OL,10,Fwill affect households on variable
OL,11,Ftariffs.
